  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我小时候阅读有关狗的杂志，甚至着了迷，终于连神灵都不信了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I was a child, I read magazines about dogs and became so obsessed that in the end I stopped even believing in spirits.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "（我对这位小姐的有关情况一无所知。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I knew absolutely nothing about this young lady.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "既没说话也不闲聊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We had neither spoken nor exchanged any idle conversation.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "处女膜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The hymen.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "圣诞节雪橇的铃声。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The bells of a Christmas sleigh.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "宛如男孩子一般，多么纯洁的千金小姐。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Like a boy, what an innocent young lady of good family she was.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "就不能看看她的脸吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could I not at least see her face?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "小姐在新婚床上，肯定会想起小宠犬的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "On her bridal bed, the young lady would surely remember her little pet dog.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "明白了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I understood.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "我爱上小姐了呀！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had fallen in love with the young lady!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "小宠犬。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The little pet dog.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "是说她活像个男孩子吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did that mean she was just like a boy?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "我在儿时，人们就说我像个男孩子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I was a child, people said I was like a boy too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "一起游泳的那个美丽少年。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That beautiful boy I swam with.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "女子高中时代的低年级同学，长相出类拔萃。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A younger schoolmate from my girls' high school days, outstanding in looks.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "铃铛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Bells.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "唱诗班。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The choir.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "少女们体态的旋律。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The melody of the girls' figures.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "故乡海港教会的礼拜堂。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The chapel of the church in my hometown harbor.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "哦，假如我和这小姐能从这教堂走出来，该多么美好啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh, how wonderful it would be if this young lady and I could walk out of that church together!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "居然说没有意识到这种事儿，那是撒谎呀！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "To say I had not been aware of such a thing would be a lie!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "我从一开始就意识到这一点。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had been aware of it from the beginning.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "小姐心里也非常明白。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The young lady understood it very well in her heart too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "我不想走出这房间。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I did not want to leave this room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "为什么？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "因为战胜这小姐是一种幸福啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Because overcoming this young lady was a kind of happiness!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "男人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A man.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "黑胡子，白鞋子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A black beard and white shoes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "寄生在青蛙肺部的广州管圆线虫。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Angiostrongylus cantonensis parasitizing a frog's lungs.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "水螅。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hydra.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "绿叉嗌。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Green forked gills.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "丈夫的显微镜里的性染色体。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sex chromosomes under my husband's microscope.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "舞毒蛾。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The gypsy moth.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "伊丽莎白女王。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Queen Elizabeth.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 36,
      "source_text": "卢克则·拉贝。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Lucrezia Rabe.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 37,
      "source_text": "男人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A man.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 38,
      "source_text": "小宠犬。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The little pet dog.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 39,
      "source_text": "我爱上这位小姐。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am in love with this young lady.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 40,
      "source_text": "今晚去银座给她买狗饼干。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Tonight I will go to Ginza and buy dog biscuits for her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 41,
      "source_text": "对了，就用你胚胎学挣来的工资，购买修指甲的工具。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, with the wages you earned from embryology, I will buy manicure tools.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01956",
      "unit_index": 42,
      "source_text": "妇产科的器械。）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Obstetrics and gynecology instruments.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
